{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":23,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ܡܙܡܘܪܐ ܕܕܘܝܕ."]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܪܵܥܝܝܼ ܝܠܹܗ، ܠܹܐ ܚܵܣܪܹܢ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܥܲܠܔ ܡܲܪ̈ܓܹܐ ܩܝܼܢܹ̈ܐ ܟܹܐ ܡܲܕܡܸܟ݂ ܠܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܠܡ̈ܝܼܵܐ ܢܝܼܚܹ̈ܐ ܟܹܐ ܡܗܲܕܹܐ ܠܝܼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܹܐ ܚܲܕܸܬ ܠܵܗ̇ ܓܵܢܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܹܐ ܠܲܒܸܠܔ ܠܝܼ ܒܫܒ݂ܝܼܠܹ̈ܐ ܕܙܲܕܝܼܩܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ ܒܘܼܬ ܫܸܡܹܗ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܘܼܦ ܟܲܕ ܚܵܕܪܹܢ ܒܪܵܘܘܿܠܵܐ ܕܛܸܠܵܢܝܼܬܵ‌ܐ ܕܡܵܘܬܵ‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܠܹܐ ܙܵܕܥܹܢ ܡ̣ܢ ܒܝܼܫܬܵ‌ܐ، ܣܵܒܵܒ ܐܲܢ݇ܬ ܥܲܡܝܼ ܝܘܸܬ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܩܵܛܝܼܘܼܟ݂ ܘܚܘܼܛܪܘܼܟ݂، ܐܵܢܝܼ ܟܹܐ ܝܵܗܒ݂ܝܼ ܠܝܼ ܠܸܒܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܹܐ ܚܵܪܙܹܬ ܩܲܕܡܝܼ ܨܘܼܦܪܵܐ، ܠܒܲܠܩܘܼܒ݂ܠܔ ܕܕܸܫ̃ܡܸܢܝܼ̈،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܫܝܼܚ ܠܘܼܟ݂ ܒܡܸܫܚܵܐ ܪܹܝܫܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܵܣܝܼ ܫܦܝܼܟ݂ܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܲܚܟ̰ܝܼ ܛܵܒ݂ܬܵ‌ܐ ܘܛܲܝܒܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ ܒܸܬ ܢܵܦܠܝܼ ܒܵܬܪܝܼ ܟܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܝܵܘܡܵܢܹ̈ܐ ܕܚܲܝܝܼ̈،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܒܸܬ ܝܵܬܒܹܢ ܓܵܘ ܒܲܝܬܵ‌ܐ ܕܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܒܝܘܼܪܟ݂ܵܐ ܕܝܵܘܡܵܢܹ̈ܐ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/23.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/24.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/22.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":6}